      <!-- FAQ -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <details style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <summary style="color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.05rem;">Which is cheaper: BirkyStudio or Goodcall?</summary>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;">
          Goodcall's Starter plan at $66/month ($792/year) is the cheapest entry point. BirkyStudio costs roughly $910-$1,150 in year one depending on usage. However, BirkyStudio includes WhatsApp, custom AI training, and real estate expertise — features Goodcall doesn't offer at any price. In year two and beyond, BirkyStudio costs less because there's no setup fee to repeat.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <summary style="color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.05rem;">Does Goodcall offer WhatsApp integration?</summary>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;">
          No. Goodcall is a phone-only platform. BirkyStudio includes WhatsApp AI alongside phone reception in every voice setup. For agents who handle leads through WhatsApp — common in Latin America, Europe, and among international buyers — BirkyStudio is the only option that covers both channels.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <summary style="color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.05rem;">Which is easier to set up: BirkyStudio or Goodcall?</summary>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;">
          BirkyStudio is easier if you don't want to do the work yourself — you describe your business and Luna builds the AI for you in 48-72 hours. Goodcall is faster to start (15-30 minutes) but you have to configure everything yourself: logic flows, prompts, forms, and responses. For non-technical agents, BirkyStudio's hands-off approach is significantly easier.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <summary style="color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.05rem;">Does BirkyStudio or Goodcall integrate with my CRM?</summary>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;">
          Neither has mature native CRM integrations yet. Goodcall offers Zapier connectivity via API for limited integrations. BirkyStudio's CRM integration is basic and coming soon with more robust options. If Zapier-based CRM integration is critical, Goodcall has a slight edge for now.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <summary style="color:white;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.05rem;">Which is better for a non-real-estate business?</summary>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;">
          Goodcall is the better choice for non-real-estate businesses. It's a general-purpose platform that works for any industry — restaurants, service businesses, retail, etc. BirkyStudio is purpose-built for real estate agents, and most of its value comes from industry-specific training. If you don't work in real estate, Goodcall is likely a better fit.
        </p>
      </details>

